  <name>Unsplash Wallpaper</name>
  <summary>Fetch and configure desktop wallpapers from Unsplash for the COSMIC™ desktop</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A panel applet for the COSMIC™ desktop environment that fetches high-resolution
      wallpapers from the Unsplash API and applies them directly to cosmic-bg.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features include configurable Unsplash API credentials, search queries, topic and collection
      filters, photographer filtering, orientation and safety filters, resolution selection,
      scaling modes, and automatic rotation intervals.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.jermowery.CosmicExtAppletUnsplash.desktop</launchable>
